EmailTemplate.textOnly:
Hello {!Lead.OwnerFirstName},

A new lead has been assigned to you in Salesforce.

Lead Details:
- Name: {!Lead.FirstName} {!Lead.LastName}
- Company: {!Lead.Company}
- Email: {!Lead.Email}
- Mobile: {!Lead.MobilePhone}
- Lead Source: {!Lead.LeadSource}

View the lead here:
{!$Site.BaseUrl}/lightning/r/Lead/{!Lead.Id}/view

Thanks
